show crypto session
show crypto session detail
Expected session status:
Interface: Virtual-Access3
Profile: CML-IKEV2
Session status: UP-ACTIVE
Check these counters:
#pkts encaps
#pkts encrypt
#pkts decaps
#pkts decrypt
Encryption and decryption counters should increase when bidirectional traffic passes through the tunnel.
